    "admit doing sth": {"zh":"承认做过某事","sentence":"He admitted taking the money but insisted he had intended to repay it.","sentenceZh":"他承认拿了钱，但坚称本打算归还。","tip":"admit 后接动名词，不接不定式；同类动词：deny、avoid、consider、postpone 均接 doing，是固定考点。","blankStart":3,"blankEnd":11,"wordId":128,"word":"admit","pos":"v.","phonetic":"[ədˈmɪt]"},
