    "aerial view": {"zh":"鸟瞰图","sentence":"From an aerial view the city looks like a circuit board crossed by rivers.","sentenceZh":"从鸟瞰角度看，这座城市像一块被河流穿过的电路板。","tip":"aerial view 常与 from 连用（from an aerial view）；写作中用于场景开头，增强画面感。","blankStart":8,"blankEnd":19,"wordId":160,"word":"aerial","pos":"adj. / n.","phonetic":"[ˈeriəl]"},
