    "affiliation with sth": {"zh":"与……的联系/从属关系","sentence":"Any affiliation with the banned organisation had to be declared in writing.","sentenceZh":"与那个被禁组织的任何联系都必须书面申报。","tip":"介词 with 表「与……的关系」；affiliation to 亦可用，但 with 更强调双方联系。","blankStart":4,"blankEnd":20,"wordId":170,"word":"affiliation","pos":"n.","phonetic":"[aˌfɪliˈeɪʃ(a)n]"},
