    "affirmative action": {"zh":"平权措施","sentence":"Affirmative action remains one of the most contested policies in American universities.","sentenceZh":"平权措施仍是美国大学中争议最大的政策之一。","tip":"固定术语，指对少数群体的倾斜性政策；阅读中常与 diversity、quota 同现，注意作者褒贬态度。","blankStart":0,"blankEnd":18,"wordId":173,"word":"affirmative","pos":"adj.","phonetic":"[aˈf3:rmatɪv]"},
