    "align (oneself) with sb": {"zh":"与某人结盟","sentence":"The small party chose to align itself with the ruling coalition.","sentenceZh":"这个小党选择与执政联盟结盟。","tip":"align with 表结盟或立场一致，反义 break with。","blankStart":25,"blankEnd":30,"wordId":228,"word":"align","pos":"v.","phonetic":"[əˈlaɪn]"},
