    "be detained by the police": {"zh":"被警方拘留","sentence":"Two journalists were detained by the police for filming near the site.","sentenceZh":"两名记者因在事发现场附近拍摄被警方拘留。","tip":"detain 表「拘留、耽搁」，名词 detention；与 arrest（逮捕）、capture（捕获）程度不同，阅读中影响定性判断。","blankStart":21,"blankEnd":43,"wordId":1787,"word":"detain","pos":"v.","phonetic":"[dɪˈteɪn]"},
