    "designate sb as sth": {"zh":"指定某人为……","sentence":"The council designated the area as a protected wetland in 2008.","sentenceZh":"议会于2008年将该区域划定为受保护的湿地。","tip":"designate sb/sth as sth 结构；designate 含官方指定意味，比 choose 更正式；名词 designation。","blankStart":12,"blankEnd":34,"wordId":1761,"word":"designate","pos":"v. / adj.","phonetic":"[ˈdezɪɡneɪt]"},
