    "disaster relief": {"zh":"赈灾","sentence":"Disaster relief arrived faster than the assessment of what was actually needed.","sentenceZh":"赈灾物资到得比需求评估还快。","tip":"relief 表「救济、缓解」，同类 tax relief、pain relief；短语搭配是阅读中的多义辨析点。","blankStart":0,"blankEnd":15,"wordId":1871,"word":"disaster","pos":"n.","phonetic":"[dɪˈzæstar]"},
